      "id": "templates-strip-whitespace-kinds",
      "spec": "hclsyntax/spec.md#template-literals",
      "rule": "Besides U+0020, a strip marker removes the other characters with Unicode's White_Space property, which is hashicorp/hcl's reading of the spec's Unicode spaces: tabs, line breaks, vertical tabs, form feeds, NEXT LINE, the line and paragraph separators, and space separators such as no-break, typographic and ideographic spaces (disputed)",
